ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es23"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"研究人群概述：签署知情同意时年龄18~75岁；慢性咳嗽病程≥8周且经规范评估（胸部影像、肺功能+支气管舒张/激发试验、FeNO、上气道与胃食管反流评估或针对性经验治疗）后仍无明确可纠正病因或治疗无效；筛选期两次24小时客观咳嗽监测平均咳嗽频率≥10次/小时；基线咳嗽VAS≥40mm；不吸烟或戒烟≥6个月。","quote_sha256":"2fc35696f84d884cc428b6c6db50d1822336122518ff506abcb9f986170641a5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es24"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄18~75岁，男女不限；慢性咳嗽病程≥8周，规范评估后符合RCC/UCC定义；筛选期两次24h客观咳嗽监测平均≥10次/小时且基线VAS≥40mm；筛选前8周内咳嗽治疗方案稳定；育龄女性妊娠试验阴性并同意有效避孕；能够使用电子咳嗽监测设备并完成电子日记；签署知情同意书","quote_sha256":"4c18ff95f9f24e4344310a77a769d683cde0c28c0168b167407dc9054db133be","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es25"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"排除标准模块：目前吸烟或筛选前6个月内戒烟；合并可能干扰咳嗽评估的呼吸系统疾病（未控制哮喘、COPD伴急性加重史、支气管扩张、活动性肺结核、IPF等间质性肺病）；血管紧张素转换酶抑制剂相关咳嗽且可替代治疗；筛选期体格检查、12导联心电图、实验室检查存在有临床意义异常；妊娠或哺乳期女性；既往使用P2X3拮抗剂类药物且缺乏疗效记录；严重心血管、肝（ALT/AST>2×ULN）、肾（eGFR<50）功能损害；近3个月内参加其他干预性临床试验","quote_sha256":"f946eaa6e2fb7eb71ea6fc39b10d2bbfc7dcaf688dc852451f522eca8719de83","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es26"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"试验干预：KZ-617 15mg、45mg、90mg口服每日两次，连续治疗12周（第1~2周为安全导入滴定：90mg组由45mg起始），匹配双模拟安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"c5f67908250eb22182ba975879c03e87c396d14bc33d095979e1aabeb60172b7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es27"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"剂量与给药方案：KZ-617片：KZ-617 15mg、45mg、90mg口服每日两次，连续治疗12周（第1~2周为安全导入滴定：90mg组由45mg起始）","quote_sha256":"c200957969c6b22ea26370c533f62cbe03fab7e91c85b93c3fc5ef467b65aa6a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es28"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"安慰剂：KZ-617 15mg、45mg、90mg口服每日两次组对照安慰剂组（模拟片每日两次），按1:1:1:1随机，分层因素为中心与基线咳嗽频率（<20 vs ≥20次/小时）。","quote_sha256":"242bf79182b0a0f43f427078e5b30fdd44b9476dea8605600cb14a907b0a4b4a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es29"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"对照：KZ-617 15mg、45mg、90mg口服每日两次组对照安慰剂组（模拟片每日两次），按1:1:1:1随机，分层因素为中心与基线咳嗽频率（<20 vs ≥20次/小时）。","quote_sha256":"41520ebb4ddc967f558fcd8052c78541abb1484aebc91fe69f14e71f688666fc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es30"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"主要研究目的：评价KZ-617三个剂量（15mg、45mg、90mg，每日两次）治疗难治性慢性咳嗽12周较安慰剂对客观咳嗽频率的改善，并进行剂量-反应分析，为Ⅲ期剂量选择提供依据。","quote_sha256":"06496326c436b58382f5e92200f5e5e28eaec7af87d2a4ec59699dab1ed77471","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es31"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"次要研究目的：评价对咳嗽相关生活质量（LCQ总分）、咳嗽严重度VAS、咳嗽缓解应答率的影响；评估日间与夜间咳嗽频率的差别效应；评价安全性与耐受性，重点描述味觉障碍、口干、头痛等不良事件。","quote_sha256":"f2505fb1db9208c7be05781ebf58c352248cc88eaafb53aa14864e2ae3155557","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es32"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"探索性研究目的：探索基线咳嗽频率、 demographic 特征与疗效的关系；采集血样进行群体药代/暴露-效应分析。","quote_sha256":"b0dfbba9aac94cd5d965b5ff09a0ff5b4c1b2ed98e3586a34893b3739ae652a5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es33"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"主要终点：治疗第12周24小时咳嗽频率（咳嗽监测设备，Leq计权每小时咳嗽次数的对数变换）较基线的变化（log-rate差）","quote_sha256":"0918a4decd17182bf6cc4a44d983d961b784745137b9c06fb4aab45aefdc25b5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es34"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"关键次要终点：第12周LCQ总分较基线变化；咳嗽缓解应答（≥50%频率下降）率","quote_sha256":"d3ee95cbe9e6d4e013a035e4ee541ec85e415f14c137d8f894dead7633f1a4e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es35"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE/SAE；味觉障碍（味觉功能问卷+客观味觉测试）；实验室；12导联心电图；生命体征","quote_sha256":"79ddd0da77ab22b5d158169fe772364ec12ae598344a956e9264a517d872d1b1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es36"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长4周，含两次24h咳嗽监测）；双盲治疗期（12周）；安全性随访（末次给药后2周）","quote_sha256":"2b3a96a46a02639cc471e8d3555ca737b6ee9dac7dc5a1ea186d83f8ed542968","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es37"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"访视策略：筛选访视（第-28~-1天）","quote_sha256":"69592413c6d94dc01d1976dd9827f9666b33bfb4a85fb2385944367da2412d6e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es38"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"基线/随机访视（第0周，随机并发放咳嗽监测设备）","quote_sha256":"2bcc83c51d7174b536885705e6aff5e7491b4b409008424108e42bd4de07d69d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es39"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"治疗访视：第2、4、8、12周","quote_sha256":"0dfb8f6a7e48d29a716ab928c215793d32211b4eda19bb9fa042685902faa83d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es40"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"安全性随访访视（末次给药后2周）","quote_sha256":"5423bf7612db57654266e3e4d0f49b979f4bf673d386589bc828703bf33feef1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es41"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"第0周与第12周访视前各完成48h（两个24h均值）咳嗽监测，第2/4/8周家庭设备单次24h","quote_sha256":"bb40fc8409fa373805ac7bb27ca478731281f2ef37b5d9317edd9e3680211043","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es42"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"估计目标策略：主要估计目标采用治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否中止研究治疗或使用补救/合并治疗，评价第12周24小时咳嗽频率（log-rate）较基线的变化。伴发事件：中止治疗者仍纳入主要分析（mITT）；补救用药记录为伴发事件并汇总描述，不作为排除依据。","quote_sha256":"0b5ecd51c13d78387c6fdfdafede8126c06e0efbf3c42c9961cc0cd1a87e812d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es43"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"样本量策略：计划入组240例（安慰剂、15mg、45mg、90mg每组各60例）。假设至少一个剂量组相对安慰剂的log-rate差为-0.20，按MCP-Mod剂量-反应整体单侧α=0.05、把握度约80%估算，脱落率按15%补偿。","quote_sha256":"3c63cd351118ee91e0ec071c2620e3c69443e5e3d3ebb70e3581d3b7a22c253e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es44"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"统计分析策略：主要终点采用MMRM（协变量：中心、基线咳嗽频率、访视及访视×治疗组别交互）；剂量-反应采用MCP-Mod（线性/Emax/指数等多剂量形状联合检验），多重性经关门程序与MCP-Mod联合控制；敏感性分析含ANCOVA与多重填补；关键次要终点LCQ变化与咳嗽缓解应答率按层级检验；安全性基于安全性分析集按组描述，味觉障碍发生率做趋势检验。","quote_sha256":"e5239288f96f353822225fea4fa15303bdbede1a46666fddbd9dee0f4d65f66a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es45"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es01","es02","es03","es04","es05","es06","es07","es08","es09","es10","es11","es12","es13","es14","es15","es17","es18","es19","es20","es21","es22","es23","es24","es25","es26","es27","es28","es29","es30","es31","es32","es33","es34","es35","es36","es37","es38","es39","es40","es41","es42","es43","es44","es45"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":44},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本方案为慢性咳嗽Ⅱ期剂量探索临床研究（方案编号R1A-KZ617-202，版本V1.0），旨在评价口服高选择性P2X3受体拮抗剂KZ-617片治疗难治性/不明原因慢性咳嗽（RCC/UCC）的剂量-反应关系与初步疗效，为Ⅲ期剂量选择提供依据。研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、四臂平行剂量探索、多中心设计，在中国开展。受试者为18~75岁、咳嗽病程≥8周且规范评估后无明确可纠正病因、基线24小时客观咳嗽频率≥10次/小时的中重度RCC/UCC成人患者。研究设安慰剂组及KZ-617 15mg、45mg、90mg三个剂量组，按1:1:1:1随机分配，分层因素为中心与基线咳嗽频率（<20次/小时与≥20次/小时）。各剂量组均为口服每日两次，连续治疗12周，其中90mg组第1~2周由45mg起始作为安全导入滴定。计划入组240例，每组60例。研究时期包括筛选期（最长4周，含两次24小时咳嗽监测）、双盲治疗期（12周）及安全性随访（末次给药后2周）。主要终点为治疗第12周24小时咳嗽频率（Leq计权每小时咳嗽次数的对数变换）较基线的变化（log-rate差）；关键次要终点为第12周LCQ总分较基线变化及咳嗽缓解应答（≥50%频率下降）率。主要终点采用MMRM分析，剂量-反应采用MCP-Mod多剂量形状联合检验，多重性经关门程序与MCP-Mod联合控制。研究设数据安全监测委员会（DMC），不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析或SRC。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实（方案编号、版本、题目、设计类型、人群定义、四臂剂量与给药方案、随机比例与分层因素、样本量、研究时期、主要及关键次要终点、统计分析策略、DMC设置等）直接撰写。医学负责人需核实：（1）90mg组安全导入滴定策略是否已有非临床安全性数据支持；（2）Leq计权log-rate终点定义与拟用咳嗽监测设备技术规格是否一致；（3）MCP-Mod多剂量形状联合检验的具体形状集合是否需在正式统计计划中进一步限定。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、剂量选择、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_4db77c337fff8e52","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d01f7d57745723567419cdb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004040445_1b877d84","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索并上传RCC/UCC中国及全球流行病学数据、疾病负担文献","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_1_epidemiology","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","疾病负担描述"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状-流行病学与疾病负担段落"},{"action":"检索并上传ERS/ACCP/中国慢性咳嗽诊治指南及当前治疗现状综述","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_1_guidelines","missing_source_classes":["诊疗指南","当前治疗现状文献"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状-诊疗指南与治疗现状段落"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","疾病负担描述","诊疗指南","当前治疗现状文献"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要RCC/UCC的流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、疾病负担）、现行诊疗指南（如ERS/ACCP咳嗽指南、中国慢性咳嗽诊治指南）及当前治疗现状（现有药物疗效局限、未满足需求）等来源方可形成实质正文。当前允许来源仅包含疾病名称缩写和P2X3靶点机制描述，不含上述任何一类来源，无法安全撰写疾病背景及治疗现状正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_6b59949a02b9bdc7","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d01f7d57745723567419cdb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004040445_1b877d84","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"靶点/作用机制：P2X3受体为ATP门控阳离子通道，高表达于气道C纤维与Aδ感觉神经末梢，气道炎症与损伤释放的ATP经P2X3/P2X2/3通道激活感觉神经，是咳嗽反射敏感化的关键机制；P2X3敲除小鼠咳嗽反射显著减弱，支持该靶点镇咳的生物学合理性。","quote_sha256":"01e393cd749ee5ab91d9f71130ad55927402e40f977e1e27fef1f37f373e8f73","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es202"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"试验药物：KZ-617片","quote_sha256":"d495eb81e24e277e27c20879eefdf42597e54c9ffa9da0696bb61441d63dcd4f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es203"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es204"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es205"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es206"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es207"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"研究题目：慢性咳嗽Ⅱ期剂量探索临床研究方案摘要（口服高选择性P2X3受体拮抗剂KZ-617片）","quote_sha256":"d8f9ddd5d1a58f56cea391ba6de67a72acf3839579a2cf1a709e275bc1d91088","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es208"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"试验干预：KZ-617 15mg、45mg、90mg口服每日两次，连续治疗12周（第1~2周为安全导入滴定：90mg组由45mg起始），匹配双模拟安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"c5f67908250eb22182ba975879c03e87c396d14bc33d095979e1aabeb60172b7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es209"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE/SAE；味觉障碍（味觉功能问卷+客观味觉测试）；实验室；12导联心电图；生命体征","quote_sha256":"79ddd0da77ab22b5d158169fe772364ec12ae598344a956e9264a517d872d1b1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es210"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"次要研究目的：评价对咳嗽相关生活质量（LCQ总分）、咳嗽严重度VAS、咳嗽缓解应答率的影响；评估日间与夜间咳嗽频率的差别效应；评价安全性与耐受性，重点描述味觉障碍、口干、头痛等不良事件。","quote_sha256":"f2505fb1db9208c7be05781ebf58c352248cc88eaafb53aa14864e2ae3155557","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es211"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"探索性研究目的：探索基线咳嗽频率、 demographic 特征与疗效的关系；采集血样进行群体药代/暴露-效应分析。","quote_sha256":"b0dfbba9aac94cd5d965b5ff09a0ff5b4c1b2ed98e3586a34893b3739ae652a5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es212"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es202","es203","es204","es205","es206","es207","es208","es209","es210","es211","es212"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":11},"gap_items":[{"action":"上传KZ-617研究者手册或药学研究资料","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_ib","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","药物化学与制剂资料"],"target":"研究药物简介-药物化学与制剂段落"},{"action":"上传KZ-617临床前及早期临床药代动力学数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_pk","missing_source_classes":["药代动力学数据"],"target":"研究药物简介-药代动力学段落"},{"action":"上传KZ-617非临床毒理学及既往人体安全性数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_safety","missing_source_classes":["非临床及既往临床安全性数据"],"target":"研究药物简介-已知安全性风险段落"}],"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","药物化学与制剂资料","药代动力学数据","非临床及既往临床安全性数据"],"proposal_text":"KZ-617片为口服高选择性P2X3受体拮抗剂，属小分子化合物，以口服固体制剂给药，产生全身性暴露。P2X3受体为ATP门控阳离子通道，高表达于气道C纤维与Aδ感觉神经末梢；气道炎症与损伤释放的ATP经P2X3/P2X2/3通道激活感觉神经，是咳嗽反射敏感化的关键机制。KZ-617通过选择性阻断P2X3受体，抑制ATP介导的感觉神经激活，从而减轻咳嗽反射敏感化。本研究中KZ-617片设15mg、45mg、90mg三个剂量，口服每日两次，连续治疗12周；90mg组第1~2周由45mg起始作为安全导入滴定。安全性评估重点关注味觉障碍、口干、头痛等不良事件，并设味觉功能问卷与客观味觉测试。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的药物名称、技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、剂型（口服固体制剂）、暴露范围（systemic）、靶点/作用机制描述、剂量与给药方案及安全性关注点撰写。P2X3敲除小鼠咳嗽反射减弱为靶点生物学验证证据，非KZ-617自身非临床数据。医学负责人需核实：（1）KZ-617对P2X3的选择性倍数及是否涉及P2X2/3异聚体；（2）味觉障碍与P2X3阻断的机制关联是否已有非临床或早期临床证据；（3）本段是否需补充药物化学结构、制剂处方或药代动力学特征（需IB或药学资料）。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_69d1ccf4fc5f4e66","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d01f7d57745723567419cdb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004040445_1b877d84","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"上传KZ-617受体选择性、功能活性及动物咳嗽模型疗效数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_1_pharm","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学研究报告"],"target":"非临床研究结果-药理学与药效学段落"},{"action":"上传KZ-617非临床ADME数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_1_pk","missing_source_classes":["非临床药代动力学数据"],"target":"非临床研究结果-药代动力学段落"},{"action":"上传KZ-617一般毒性、安全药理学、遗传毒性、生殖毒性研究报告","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_1_tox","missing_source_classes":["非临床毒理学研究报告"],"target":"非临床研究结果-毒理学段落"},{"action":"上传KZ-617研究者手册（IB）或等效非临床综述文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_1_ib","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）"],"target":"非临床研究结果-整体非临床概述"}],"heading":"非临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学研究报告","非临床药代动力学数据","非临床毒理学研究报告","研究者手册（IB）"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要KZ-617的非临床药理学研究结果（受体结合选择性、功能活性、动物咳嗽模型疗效）、非临床药代动力学数据、非临床毒理学研究（一般毒性、安全药理学、遗传毒性、生殖毒性）及既往非临床研究报告或已发表文献方可形成实质正文。当前允许来源中仅含靶点机制描述和P2X3敲除小鼠靶点验证信息，不含KZ-617自身的任何非临床研究数据，无法安全撰写非临床研究结果正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_e8b67343fb77f406","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d01f7d57745723567419cdb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"964dca1c3164c651b0d0ec3752232b863cce02402b8b52b4295ecc0e9b8b2383","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_4599f7b526b2bbc8:full-draft:d01f7d57745723567419cdb8","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:d01f7d57745723567419cdb8